  "question": {
    "text": "Two electric bulbs, rated at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> are connected in series across a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>V</mtext></math> voltage source. If the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> bulbs draw powers <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively, then:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math>",
